<p>Implication for Aurora&#x27;s 610k bird flock - the operating reality is a ~720-800k total population at any one time once you include the parallel pullet population (~120k). Cycle through 600k birds every ~15-18 months. The bird is a depreciating asset on an 18-month clock (Calder [00:30:46] - the operational read).</p>
