<p>Note (Calder [00:07:42]+[00:10:48]): &quot;Spent-hen disposal is closer to a cost than a revenue line on a modern NZ layer farm... If a sell-side deck is treating spent-hen disposal as a hidden value lever, I&#x27;d want to see the offtake contract, not the research note.&quot;</p>
