<p>Consenting overlay (Part 8 [00:18:48]+[00:23:42]):</p>
<p>- Both Aurora sites sit on rural-production-zoned land. - Both sit on HPL-overlay soils (NPS Highly Productive Land, October 2022). Most of the Canterbury Plains is LUC Class 1-2; most of the Waikato dairy/mixed-cropping belt is LUC 1-3. - Consenting timeline 24-36 months scoping-to-determination, plus submitter and Environment Court appeal rights. - Practical effect: a buyer absorbing the consenting pathway is paying for option value, not realised value.</p>
<h3>5. aurora-site optionality read - part 8 [00:23:42]+[00:27:18] verbatim</h3>
