<p>NB: Test this framing rigorously. Calthorpe Part 8 + Calder operator read directly contradict the realizability of the alternative-use optionality on either site at a buy-out premium.</p>
<h3>7. T4 briefing-video primer + T3 deck-read text</h3>
<p>T4 video opens with the business-model primer before the findings + open-questions sections (per Vivian, 6 June Slack thread - &quot;the senior partner needs the basics before the findings&quot;). Suggested primer (~12-15 seconds at briefing pacing):</p>
