<p>T3 deck risk-register / open-questions section addition:</p>
<p>&quot;alternative-use optionality - sell-side broker has framed both Aurora sites as carrying meaningful land-bank optionality beyond the egg business (data-center, solar, dairy conversion). Independent industry expert read (Calthorpe Part 8) and operator read (Calder) directly contradict the realizability of that optionality on either of Aurora&#x27;s two specific sites: both sit on rural-production-zoned, HPL-overlay land, both are outside the Auckland NW data-center cluster, with 24-36 month consenting risk on any non-rural use. Treat as open question on confirmatory diligence - is there a specific named non-egg buyer prepared to bid at a premium to rural-production going- concern - rather than as a bottom-line opportunity in the headline valuation.&quot;</p>
